# Captured 2026-09-10 with WLR_HEADLESS_OUTPUTS=2: two heads, sway
# placing HEADLESS-2 at 1280 and HEADLESS-1 at 2560. Xwayland pairs
# them the other way round -- output 0x21 on crtc 0x20 is HEADLESS-2 at
# x=1280 and output 0x23 on crtc 0x22 is HEADLESS-1 at x=2560 -- which
# is why a proxy takes output NAMES from GetOutputInfo and never
# assumes an order. This is R2's rig (scratchpad/b7/cap2.log conn 14).
# GetOutputInfo(0x23): crtc 0x22, name HEADLESS-1.
